TITLE:: ProbeSpectralDashboard
summary:: Synchronized Multi-Panel Spectral Analysis Console
categories:: GUI>Visualizers, Live Coding>Telemetry

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeSpectralDashboard unifies high-resolution FFT spectrum analysis, 16-band ISO octave analysis, real-time spectral descriptors HUD (Centroid, Flatness, Roll-off, Flux/Onsets), pitch and voicing confidence tracking, 12-tone harmonic chromagram, time-frequency density spectrogram, 3D waterfall, and differential A/B spectral comparison into a synchronized, theme-aware laboratory console.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Open a new standalone window containing the spectral dashboard.
argument:: server
The Server to monitor. Defaults to link::Classes/Server#*default::.
argument:: busIndex
The audio bus index to monitor. Default: 0.
argument:: theme
A theme name symbol (e.g. \graphite, \phosphor, \ice, \amber, \paper, \monochrome) or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance. Default: \graphite.
returns:: A new ProbeSpectralDashboard instance.

METHOD:: view
Embed the spectral dashboard into a custom parent link::Classes/View:: or link::Classes/Window::.
argument:: parent
The parent view or window.
argument:: bounds
The link::Classes/Rect:: defining position and dimensions.
argument:: server
The Server to monitor. Defaults to link::Classes/Server#*default::.
argument:: busIndex
The audio bus index to monitor. Default: 0.
argument:: theme
A theme name symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance. Default: \graphite.
returns:: A PB_SpectralDashboardView composite view.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: dashboardView
returns:: The underlying PB_SpectralDashboardView composite view.

METHOD:: window
returns:: The link::Classes/Window:: containing the dashboard.

METHOD:: preset
Set the active layout preset.
argument:: aPreset
One of \overview, \pitch, \timeFreq, or \compare.

METHOD:: theme
Set the active link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: across all sub-panels.
argument:: aTheme
A theme name symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: instance.

METHOD:: fontScale
Set the font scaling multiplier (e.g. 1.0, 1.25, 1.5).
argument:: scale
A Float scale factor.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle live data rendering freeze across all sub-panels.

METHOD:: close
Close the window and release all broker subscriptions and sub-views.

EXAMPLES::

CODE::
s.boot;

// Synthesize complex harmonic spectrum
x = { Saw.ar(110) + Pulse.ar(220, SinOsc.kr(0.5).range(0.1, 0.9)) * 0.2 }.play;

// Open Spectral Dashboard
d = ProbeSpectralDashboard(s, 0, \graphite);

// Switch presets
d.preset = \pitch;
d.preset = \timeFreq;
d.preset = \compare;
d.preset = \overview;

// Freeze/unfreeze
d.toggleFreeze;

// Close
d.close;
x.free;
::
